# The GBA page with art (Settings' game view, slot 31): START opens the game
# popup with its 8 items (Saves among them). The art list leaves block 0's
# free tiles too short for the titled card, so it opens without its title
# rather than not at all (v0.5's START on the GBA list did nothing).
#! settings 31=1
#! sd-file "/torii/art/custom/A name too long to fit on its row.gba.bin" 0 tests/shots/data/art-sunset.bin
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "nav: page gba ready"
-w "box art: cover"
-k @30:START -k @34:-
-w "screen ready: game-popup"
-s @30:popup.png
